          "But Jesus turned the meaning of rank upside down: “You know that they who are recognized as rulers over the nations lord it over them… But it shall not be so among you, but whoever wants to become great among you shall be your servant” (Mark 10:42-43). He washed his disciples’ feet (John 13:12-15). Peter tells elders not to lord it over the flock (1 Pet 5:3).",
